{
    "title": "Miraibo GO",
    "description": "Download the mobile monster-themed open world survival game now! Get ready to tame various monsters with your friends and explore the world anytime anywhere! Hundreds of classic monsters await you in this exciting adventure!\r\nExplore the world, capture monsters, fight enemies, build a base, and establish a new monster utopia together! More ways to play are waiting for you to discover!\r\n\r\nTame Monsters   Hundreds of monsters await you!\r\nMore than 100 classic monsters with different skills and elements will accompany you on your adventure! Worried about not being powerful enough? Defeat bosses to improve your team strength!\r\n\r\nBase Construction   Let your monsters manage automatic production!\r\nLead monsters to implement automatic construction and production in your base! Assign different monsters to different tasks based on their specialties and characteristics, including farming, gathering and production! Oh, and don't forget to prepare enough food and water for them, and give them enough time to rest and play! As the saying goes, all work and no play makes Jack a dull boy!\r\n\r\nMounted Exploration   Fight alongside your tame monsters!\r\nFrom the simplest wooden stick to the most powerful modern weaponry, there's plenty of equipment to help you take on the fiercest bosses! Throw the sphere to capture them when they are weak and make them be a member of your monster team. Use their unique skills and abilities to survive in this perilous world!\r\n\r\nMultiplayer Battle   Explore and adventure with your friends!\r\nInvite your friends to build a base and survive together in the open world, while defeating bosses and enjoying the fun of fighting and exploring! But don't forget to stay alert, for your friends may turn against you at any time to plunder resources! There are no permanent enemies, and no permanent friends, only permanent interests!\r\n\r\nDevice requirements:\r\nCPU: Kirin 710 or Snapdragon 665 above\r\nRAM: 4GB or more\r\nStorage Space:3G of available storage space or more\r\n\r\nFollow the official website and official community for more information and events!\r\nOfficial website: miraibogo.dreamcubegame.com\r\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/MiraiboGO\r\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/8vYuhykUbZ\r\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@MiraiboGO\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/miraibogo\r\nX: https://x.com/MiraiboGO",
